tape-base58
Copyright 2026 Tape Network

The conversion algorithm — a base 58^5 intermediate form with fixed tables
between base 2^32 words and base 58^5 limbs — follows Firedancer's fd_base58,
Apache-2.0.
https://github.com/firedancer-io/firedancer/tree/main/src/ballet/base58

No Firedancer source is included. The tables in src/tables.rs are generated
from the defining identities by tools/gen_tables.py.

five8 by Kevin Heavey (MIT) informed the shape of the fixed-size entry points.
